---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Card from '~/components/docs/Card.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Documentation — DNA Codes',
  description: 'Operational DNA: structure and behaviour. Product and Technology are coming soon.',
};
---

<PageLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl dark:text-white">DNA documentation</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Describe the business in Operational DNA: its structure, then the behaviour on that structure. Product and
        Technology are the layers that follow. Their reference is still being written.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <Card
        title="Getting Started"
        description="Write a structure document, then attach behaviour."
        contents="Quickstart · structure/v1 · behaviour/v1"
        href="/docs/getting-started/"
      />
      <Card
        title="Reference"
        description="Operational DNA, generated from the core schemas."
        contents="Structure · Behaviour"
        href="/docs/operational/"
      />
      <Card
        title="Lenses"
        description="Named graph patterns that turn one DNA model into many views."
        contents="Operational · People · Access Control · Execution"
        href="/docs/lenses/"
      />
      <Card
        title="Examples"
        description="The reference domains the core schemas are held to."
        contents="Checkout · Origination · Diligence · Agent registration"
        href="/docs/examples/"
      />
      <Card
        title="Framework Comparisons"
        description="Mappings to the modeling frameworks you already know."
        contents="DDD · BPMN · ArchiMate · C4 · Event Storming · TOGAF"
        href="/docs/frameworks/"
      />
    </div>

    <div id="coming-soon" class="scroll-mt-24 mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Coming soon</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-400">
        Operational DNA is the layer documented today. Two further layers are part of the model, and their reference is
        not written yet.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Product.</strong> What gets built from the model: the resources, APIs,
          and interfaces a team ships.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Technology.</strong> How that model is bound and deployed: the cells,
          providers, and environments it runs in.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
